  "text_pages": [
    "Exchange Students – Østfold University of Applied Sciences\nExchange Students\nTake your exchange semester with us! We offer a wide range of courses that provide students with specialized skills within their respective fields, modern teaching and research facilities, an active student life and proximity to nature and great outdoors activities.\nMeet our exchange students and their professors!\nDeadlines\nNomination period\nAutumn: March 1 - April 15\nSpring: September 1 - October 15\nApplication deadline\nAutumn semester: May 1\nSpring semester: November 1\n*The Norwegian Theatre Academy is no longer accepting exchange students.\nStarting your studies\nArrival dates and information meeting\nGo to semester start\nCourses for exchange students\nGo to courses\nHow to nominate and apply\nGo to application\nUpcoming activities\nExchange students have the opportunity to participate in various activities throughout the year to get better aquainted with Østfold and with each other. Here you will find a calendar of events with information about how to sign-up!\n27\n.\nOct.\n'Belgian' Board Games\nOct. 27, 2026 12:00 PM\n–\n3:00 PM\nStudies\nAcademic calendar\nCredit system and grading\nDegree structure\nDiploma and transcript\nFactsheet\nBefore arrival\nInformation about arrival\nHousing\nVisas & Permits\nRegistration\nSpecial Needs\nServices and tools\nNomination portal\nApplication portal\nStudentweb\nCanvas\nOnline Schedule\nWhy choose Østfold University of Applied Sciences\nOur university offers a wide range of courses taught in English and exchange students can expect small class sizes allowing for close interaction with faculty and fellow students.\nWhy choose Østfold University of Applied Sciences?\nLiving in Halden & Fredrikstad\nActive student life on our campuses\nBuddy scheme for international student\nErasmus+ Global\nFrom India and Taiwan to Fredrikstad: International students bring a global perspective to OUAS.\nRead about their experience at OUAS during the Spring 2026 semester.\nArena for internship\nRead an interview with one of our partners for internships!\nFor a few lucky students, there is the opportunity to do an internship through Østfold University of Applied Sciences. We have programs for exchange students with internships in many different fields. One of those is Hjørgunn Farm. Read an interview with them here.\nContact us\nDo you have questions about our student exchange programmes?\nFind contact information"
